From 4cb5d43c0775020a616d95a08265887b3dffc20f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 05:18:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pad: replace the touch icons with the gunmetal image set
 (0107)

Dark gray metal buttons cut from the user's reference image, replacing
the red set (0105, reverted). ZL / L / ZR / R are round buttons, not
teardrops; the D-pad is one connected cross (pad_dpad) instead of four
arms; there is no ship decoration. The right stick's small button keeps
its label as drawn in the source image (P3). Pressed state does not
change the artwork; only the left stick's knob moves.
